{"id": 20, "ok": true, "cmd": "asymptotic", "ucas": "asymptotic sum(k, 1, n, 1/k)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "asymptotic", "euler_maclaurin": "int f + C + f(n)/2 + B2/2! f'(n) + B4/4! f'''(n), B2 = 1/6, B4 = -1/30", "headline": "sum(k, 1, n, 1/k) ~ log(n) + gamma + 1/(2n) - 1/(12n^2) + 1/(120n^4) + ...", "details": ["the constant C = 0.577215664901532 = gamma"]}, "results": [{"kind": "asymptotic"}, {"kind": "asymptotic", "euler_maclaurin": "int f + C + f(n)/2 + B2/2! f'(n) + B4/4! f'''(n), B2 = 1/6, B4 = -1/30", "headline": "sum(k, 1, n, 1/k) ~ log(n) + gamma + 1/(2n) - 1/(12n^2) + 1/(120n^4) + ...", "details": ["the constant C = 0.577215664901532 = gamma"]}], "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "n = 10: sum 2.92896825397, expansion off by 3.9e-09; n = 100: sum 5.18737751764, expansion off by 2.7e-15; n = 1000: sum 7.48547086055, expansion off by 0"}], "files": [], "text": "sum(k, 1, n, 1/k) ~ log(n) + gamma + 1/(2n) - 1/(12n^2) + 1/(120n^4) + ...\n  Euler-Maclaurin: int f + C + f(n)/2 + B2/2! f'(n) + B4/4! f'''(n), B2 = 1/6, B4 = -1/30\n  the constant C = 0.577215664901532 = gamma\n  check: n = 10: sum 2.92896825397, expansion off by 3.9e-09; n = 100: sum 5.18737751764, expansion off by 2.7e-15; n = 1000: sum 7.48547086055, expansion off by 0\n"}
